      "mechanism_id": "s_matrix_eigenvalue",
      "statement": "The S-matrix eigenvalue for two dark spin waves is given by s(P,E) = L(P,E-i0)/L(P,E+i0). As E approaches E_max, s -> 1; as E approaches E_sadd, s -> -1. The unitarity |s| -> 1 at critical energies decouples the dark-wave channel from photon channels.",
